<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Additional Ablations ‣ ModernVBERT: Towards Smaller Visual Document Retrievers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Late Interaction for Non-Documental Retrieval</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
